#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:2
msgid "Set Up Godot Integration"
msgstr "设置 Godot 集成"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:5
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:7
msgid ""
"The bundled Godot editor integration requires Godot 4.5 or newer. Studio "
"can still hold a workspace and work with ordinary files without a "
"connected Godot editor, but editor-aware tools and the bundled plugin "
"depend on a compatible Godot installation."
msgstr "随附的 Godot 编辑器集成要求 Godot 4.5 或更高版本。即使没有连接 Godot 编辑器，Studio 仍然可以保留工作区并处理普通文件；但编辑器感知工具和随附插件依赖兼容的 Godot 安装。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:13
msgid "Select the Godot executable"
msgstr "选择 Godot 可执行文件"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:15
msgid ""
"During first-run setup or from **Settings > General**, select the Godot "
"executable that Studio should use for project validation and launch "
"actions. Studio checks the executable and shows the detected version. If "
"the executable cannot be validated, select the correct binary for your "
"platform and confirm that it is not blocked or incomplete."
msgstr "在首次运行设置期间，或从 **Settings > General** 中选择 Studio 用于项目验证和启动操作的 Godot 可执行文件。Studio 会检查该可执行文件并显示检测到的版本。如果无法验证，请为你的平台选择正确的二进制文件，并确认它没有被阻止或安装不完整。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:22
msgid "Install the Bridge plugin"
msgstr "安装 Bridge 插件"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:24
msgid "Open **Settings > Godot Projects**."
msgstr "打开 **Settings > Godot Projects**。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:25
msgid "Add or rescan the project you want to connect."
msgstr "添加或重新扫描希望连接的项目。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:26
msgid "Confirm that the project targets Godot 4.5 or newer."
msgstr "确认项目目标版本为 Godot 4.5 或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:27
msgid "Select the project and choose **Install**."
msgstr "选择项目并选择 **Install**。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:28
msgid "Close and reopen Godot if Studio reports that a plugin change is pending."
msgstr "如果 Studio 报告插件变更待处理，请关闭并重新打开 Godot。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:30
msgid ""
"The plugin is a lightweight editor client. It connects the Godot editor "
"to Daedalus tools and diagnostics; it does not replace the project files "
"or the Godot editor itself."
msgstr "该插件是轻量级编辑器客户端。它将 Godot 编辑器连接到 Daedalus 工具和诊断功能，不会替代项目文件或 Godot 编辑器本身。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:35
msgid "Connection checklist"
msgstr "连接检查清单"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:37
msgid "If editor-aware tools are unavailable:"
msgstr "如果编辑器感知工具不可用："

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:39
msgid "make sure the selected executable points to the expected Godot version;"
msgstr "确认选定的可执行文件指向预期的 Godot 版本；"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:40
msgid "open the intended project in that Godot installation;"
msgstr "在该 Godot 安装中打开目标项目；"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:41
msgid "confirm the plugin is installed for that project;"
msgstr "确认该项目已安装插件；"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:42
msgid "restart Godot after a staged plugin update;"
msgstr "插件更新暂存后重新启动 Godot；"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:43
msgid ""
"check the project and Studio versions in **Settings > About** and the "
"Godot project status page."
msgstr "在 **Settings > About** 和 Godot 项目状态页面中检查项目和 Studio 版本。"

#: ../../source/godot/setup.rst:46
msgid ""
"Static project tools can still inspect validated files when no editor is "
"connected. The agent should report when a requested operation needs a "
"live editor capability that is not available."
msgstr "没有连接编辑器时，静态项目工具仍可以检查经过验证的文件。如果请求的操作需要当前不可用的实时编辑器能力，agent 应该明确报告。"
